color:var(--background-color-error-subtle,#ffeeee);color:var(--color-base,#202122)}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer.warningLicenseContainer>div:first-child>div:first-child>div:first-child>div:nth-child(2)>div:nth-child(2){border:2px solid var(--border-color-error,#b22222);color:var(--color-base,#202122)}</style><div class=\"licenseContainer licenseBanner dynlayout-exempt\">\n<div><div><div><div>\n<p><span class=\"imageLeft\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/60px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/120px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"196\" data-file-height=\"196\" /></span></span></span>\n</p>\n</div><div>\n<div>\n<p>此北宋作品在全世界都属于<b><a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AC%E6%9C%89%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:公有领域\">公有领域</a></b>，因为作者逝世已经超过100年，且作品于1931年1月1日之前出版。\n</p>\n</div>\n</div><div>\n<p><span class=\"noimageRight\"></span>\n</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"licensetpl\">\n<p><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;short\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;long\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;link&#95;req\">false</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;attr&#95;req\">false</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">回鶻可汗王仁美遣使者來　按薛史卷三二唐莊宗紀、卷一三八回鶻傳、冊府元龜（下簡稱冊府）卷九六七及五代會要卷二八並云：同光二年仁美卒；天成三年，唐明宗封仁裕為順化可汗。本史卷七四四夷附錄略同。而本史本卷順應元年、清泰二年及卷八晉高祖紀天福三年、四年，凡四次記仁美遣使、受封事。二十二史考異（下簡稱考異）卷六一謂「此四條『仁美』字似皆『仁裕』之訛」。今查薛史卷七八晉高祖紀、冊府卷九七二于清泰、天福中，亦屢書仁美入貢、受封。是記載前後矛盾，非止本史，孰是孰非，有待詳考。</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">慈州刺史宋令詢死之　「慈州」，薛史卷四六唐末帝紀及通鑑卷二七九作「磁州」。</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐589d68cf68‐rzrwp\nCached time: 20260911220138\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Template:PD‐old (currentyear)\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.119 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 248/1000000\nRevision size: 9113/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 10145/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1291/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3787/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.024/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 872270/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 1/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  102.011      1 -total\n 53.61%   54.686      1 Template:Header2\n 26.04%   26.561      1 Template:北宋作品\n 23.91%   24.394      1 Template:PD-old\n 21.98%   22.423      1 Template:License\n 12.53%   12.787      1 Template:Textquality\n  6.09%    6.208      1 Template:Plain_sister\n  3.74%    3.818      1 Template:Main_subject\n  2.08%    2.125      1 Template:Footer\n  1.30%    1.329      2 Template:Gap\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID 5c911981-ae2c-11f1-8484-7d1190bd8ccb -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key zhwikisource:pcache:100538:|#|:idhash:canonical!zh and timestamp 20260911220138 and revision id 1744386. Rendering was triggered because: page_view\n -->\n</div>"
